    "variationPolicy": "Variation comes from authored module combinations and explicit variants; runtime random geometry is prohibited.",
    "replacementPolicy": "Every production module records the graybox object or reserved envelope it replaces. Unmapped modules cannot enter a locked navigation or sightline envelope."
  },
